      "quote": "We do not collect any gameplay data via third party tools or our own tools for any purpose"
    },
    {
      "ref": "D344",
      "area": "data",
      "claim": "The privacy notice explains that \"gameplay data is stored in your account storage to sync your game progress across devices\" and that \"You can delete your User Data stored in your account via the settings menu\"",
